# OMNeT++ Compiled Files
/out/
/src/**/*.o
/src/**/Makefile
Makefile

# Simulation Results (Don't push huge datasets!)
/results/
*.vec
*.sca
*.vci

# IDE Settings (Optional - usually better to share basic settings but ignore user specific)
.settings/
.cproject
.project
# NOTE: If you exclude .project/.cproject, your colleague must "Import" as a new project.
# If you INCLUDE them, they get your settings but might have path conflicts.
# Recommendation: KEEP .project and .cproject but ensure paths inside are relative.